grep — GNU text-search command

This r10 candidate rebuilds the reviewed Buildroot 2025.02.1 recipe with the
baseline PCRE2 feature enabled.  `libpcre2-8` is its separately owned exact
runtime dependency.  Only the real `grep` executable is exposed through a
private-path `/usr/bin/grep` frontend; the upstream compatibility shell scripts
`egrep` and `fgrep` are deliberately omitted because their PATH lookup could
fall back to BusyBox.
